 ("h","Typical ranges by website type"),("ul",["A 1–3 page business site: roughly Rs. 15,000 and up.","A 5–10 page company site with blog and analytics: roughly Rs. 25,000 and up.","A site with an online store and payment gateway: roughly Rs. 40,000 and up.","A large custom platform or marketplace: roughly Rs. 80,000 and up."]),
